- [layout.tsx](src/app/layout.tsx), [globals.css](src/app/globals.css) — dark-by-default shell, project metadata
- [utils.ts](src/lib/utils.ts) — `cn()` helper (clsx + tailwind-merge)

**Env & git**
- [.env.example](.env.example) with `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=` / `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=`
