## What changed

**Store** — [editor.ts](src/store/editor.ts): `TextOverlay` now carries `startTime` (default 0) and `endTime` (default `min(5, duration)`), plus `setOverlayStartTime(id, time)` / `setOverlayEndTime(id, time)` actions that snap to the 0.1s grid and clamp invariants (start ≤ end ≤ duration). When a video's duration resolves — including the seek-past-end path for MediaRecorder WebMs — existing overlays are re-clamped to it.

**Renderer** — [render.ts](src/lib/render.ts): `drawScene` takes a `sceneTime` and skips any overlay where `sceneTime < startTime || sceneTime > endTime`.

**Exporter** — [exporter.ts](src/lib/exporter.ts): `renderFrame` now receives the exact frame timestamp — `trimStart + i/fps` in the WebCodecs loop, `video.currentTime` in the MediaRecorder fallback — so mp4-muxer compilation honors the window per-frame. Both callers were rewired ([page.tsx](src/app/(workspace)/editor/[projectId]/page.tsx), [preview-panel.tsx](src/components/editor/preview-panel.tsx)).

